# Cap below 5.0: passlib 1.7.4 (the latest release, unmaintained since 2020)
# is incompatible with bcrypt 5.x — its backend probe hashes an over-length
# string, which bcrypt 5 rejects with "password cannot be longer than 72
# bytes" instead of truncating. That failed every auth/key/quota test in CI.
bcrypt>=4.1.0,<5.0
